  "add": [
    "In sprint 1, build movement and jumping on simple blocks, including restart after falling, and share a playable build.",
    "In sprint 2, make one short, unpolished level with a start and finish, and share a playable link with controls.",
    "In sprints 3 and 4, watch two people try the level and fix blocking problems, then share the final playable link and test notes."
  ],
